UPDATE businesses SET description = 'attooh! is an authorised financial services provider operating from Unit 1C, Menlyn Woods Office Park, 291 Sprite Avenue, Faerie Glen, Pretoria. Registered as FSP 32189, the company offers a broad range of personal and business financial solutions, including personal and family insurance, short-term insurance, and health and gap cover. It also provides life, disability and income-protection cover, along with investment and retirement-planning services. For businesses, attooh! offers fiduciary services and business-assurance solutions designed to manage company risk. The firm serves individuals and families seeking to protect their assets and plan for the future, as well as business owners and companies looking for tailored insurance, wealth-management and business-risk solutions. By combining short-term and long-term insurance products with investment and retirement planning under one roof, attooh! positions itself as a one-stop financial services partner for clients navigating both personal and commercial financial needs. Operating from its Faerie Glen office, the company serves clients across the greater Pretoria area who require professional guidance on insurance, financial planning and risk management, backed by its status as a licensed and authorised financial services provider.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'attooh-willow-glen' AND description = 'attooh! is an authorised financial services provider (FSP 32189) offering comprehensive financial planning, including life, health and investment insurance plus retirement and estate planning, from its Faerie Glen office.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
